{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1408"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c118): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c118.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1408"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/tv","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__tv.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",162],["+","most famous single episode is „Reifezeugnis“, directed by Wolfgang Petersen and broadcast on 27 March 1977, in which the young Nastassja Kinski played the schoolgirl Sina Wolf, whose affair with her teacher ends in a killing. Its longest-serving team came from Bavaria: from 1991 Miroslav Nemec and Udo Wachtveitl investigated in Munich as Ivo Batic and Franz Leitmayr, longer than any other pair in the series. Its "],["=",656],["+","ZDF also gave a woman a long run at the top. From 5 November 1994 to 12 October 2013 Iris Berben played the Berlin inspector Rosa Roth in 31 feature-length films, a melancholy, independent investigator who carried the series for almost twenty years.\n\n"],["=",117],["+","\n| „Rosa Roth“ | ZDF | 1994 |"]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",136],["+","Seine berühmteste Einzelfolge ist „Reifezeugnis“, inszeniert von Wolfgang Petersen und am 27. März 1977 ausgestrahlt, in der die junge Nastassja Kinski die Schülerin Sina Wolf spielte, deren Affäre mit ihrem Lehrer in einer Tötung endet. Das dienstälteste Team kam aus Bayern: Ab 1991 ermittelten Miroslav Nemec und Udo Wachtveitl als Ivo Batic und Franz Leitmayr in München, länger als jedes andere Duo der Reihe. "],["=",642],["+","Das ZDF ließ auch eine Frau lange an der Spitze stehen. Vom 5. November 1994 bis zum 12. Oktober 2013 spielte Iris Berben in 31 Filmen in Spielfilmlänge die Berliner Kommissarin Rosa Roth, eine melancholische, eigenständige Ermittlerin, die die Reihe fast zwanzig Jahre lang trug.\n\n"],["=",115],["+","\n| „Rosa Roth“ | ZDF | 1994 |"]]}]},
{"seq":3,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1408"},"reason":"a1408 body: Batic/Leitmayr \"investigated … longer than any other pair\" + \"until their farewell double episode at Easter 2026\" — the Munich duo ended in April 2026 — https://www.abendzeitung-muenchen.de/tv/tatort-abschied-in-muenchen-fans-feiern-und-weinen-beim-letzten-fall-art-1123604","by":"enrich batch 066","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a1348-a1576.md","sources":[{"url":"https://www.abendzeitung-muenchen.de/tv/tatort-abschied-in-muenchen-fans-feiern-und-weinen-beim-letzten-fall-art-1123604"}]},
